// Typed interval atlas facade.
//
// Importing this path is enough to declare a typed atlas binding and to use the
// whole typed surface.  The implementation is split by responsibility:
//
//   segment_record.slang   whole-record read/write and ray composition
//   probe_resolve.slang    probe radiance and completeness
//
// The legacy float4 atlas is a different record format and is deliberately not
// exported here.  Binding one format as the other is invalid.  All operations
// are whole-record accesses and require the caller to synchronize readers and
// writers.
//
// `capacity` in every signature is the number of RCSegment elements in the
// bound descriptor range, not bytes or the allocation's full size.  The host
// must validate the reflected record stride and descriptor range before
// dispatch.  The canonical layout is generated by radianceCascadeLayout();
// fabricated layouts are rejected before any record is read or written.

public module segment_store;

__exported import "radiance_cascades/segment_record.slang";
__exported import "radiance_cascades/probe_resolve.slang";
